diskcapd for Debian
===================

Initial setup
-------------

Configure diskcapd for this machine:

    sudo diskcapd setup

Verify the configuration:

    sudo diskcapd status

Run one manual monitoring check:

    sudo diskcapd check --quiet

Enable automatic monitoring:

    sudo systemctl enable --now diskcapd.timer

The package deliberately does not enable or start automatic monitoring
until machine-specific setup has been completed.
